{"2951690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sonic Rumble Party", "steam_appid": 2951690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐READY, SET, RUMBLE! </h2>Join Sonic in the ultimate arcade royale where up to 32 players battle for glory in this free-to-play cross-platform game! It's not just a race, it's a Rumble!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/82125e435dd3976cd85b5dce4bed7d30.poster.avif?t=1787628064\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/82125e435dd3976cd85b5dce4bed7d30.webm?t=1787628064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/82125e435dd3976cd85b5dce4bed7d30.mp4?t=1787628064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡️EPIC SONIC ACTION </h2>Dash, spin, and speed through iconic stages, while mastering skills in the chaos of Dr.Eggman’s Toy World. From Green Hill Zone to Sky Sanctuary, experience the distinctive, high-speed Sonic gameplay in familiar and all-new levels! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/798623722c16d81f2f2fc77198b30464.avif?t=1787628064\" width=616 height=347 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💥MAYHEM IS BEST WITH FRIENDS </h2>Connect, compete, and play together! Squad up with friends and family in chaotic survival battles. Who will be the world’s top Rumbler? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/850ac6379456e491a3a7102e6fe45d78.poster.avif?t=1787628064\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/850ac6379456e491a3a7102e6fe45d78.webm?t=1787628064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/850ac6379456e491a3a7102e6fe45d78.mp4?t=1787628064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏁TRIUMPH IN THE TOY WORLD </h2>Dr. Eggman has constructed a diabolical Toy World, complete with twisted obstacle courses and intense arenas. Master all of the exciting stages and game modes, from frantic races to epic survival battles. Emerge triumphant, claim your crown and win amazing rewards! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/e444b8801262c644f80ff2ec573a03f4.avif?t=1787628064\" width=616 height=347 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👨‍🎤A LEGENDARY LINEUP  </h2>Play as Sonic, Tails, Knuckles, Amy, Shadow, Dr. Eggman, and other Sonic-series favorites! <br>Customize your characters to your heart’s content with a variety of skins, animations, emotes, effects, and more! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/19b18ca52439c48412dc1a0e6b9f577b.poster.avif?t=1787628064\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/19b18ca52439c48412dc1a0e6b9f577b.webm?t=1787628064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/19b18ca52439c48412dc1a0e6b9f577b.mp4?t=1787628064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📱RUMBLE AT HOME OR ON THE GO</h2>Sonic Rumble Party is available on both PC and mobile, offering a seamless and speedy experience whenever and wherever! Dash into the world of Sonic and experience the thrill and mayhem on your preferred platform.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/f8d84c7cd9f4102b26bf871818765243.poster.avif?t=1787628064\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/f8d84c7cd9f4102b26bf871818765243.webm?t=1787628064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/f8d84c7cd9f4102b26bf871818765243.mp4?t=1787628064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎵A STANDOUT SONIC SOUNDTRACK </h2>Sonic Rumble Party features fast-paced tunes for those with a need for speed. Keep an ear out for iconic bangers from the Sonic series and groove along to some familiar anthems!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/a64d454497d8aeb7afba7eb4ae43eeb0.poster.avif?t=1787628064\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/a64d454497d8aeb7afba7eb4ae43eeb0.webm?t=1787628064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/a64d454497d8aeb7afba7eb4ae43eeb0.mp4?t=1787628064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐READY, SET, RUMBLE! </h2>Join Sonic in the ultimate arcade royale where up to 32 players battle for glory in this free-to-play cross-platform game! It's not just a race, it's a Rumble!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/82125e435dd3976cd85b5dce4bed7d30.poster.avif?t=1787628064\" width=6