azing rewards! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/e444b8801262c644f80ff2ec573a03f4.avif?t=1787628064\" width=616 height=347 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👨‍🎤A LEGENDARY LINEUP  </h2>Play as Sonic, Tails, Knuckles, Amy, Shadow, Dr. Eggman, and other Sonic-series favorites! <br>Customize your characters to your heart’s content with a variety of skins, animations, emotes, effects, and more! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/19b18ca52439c48412dc1a0e6b9f577b.poster.avif?t=1787628064\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/19b18ca52439c48412dc1a0e6b9f577b.webm?t=1787628064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/19b18ca52439c48412dc1a0e6b9f577b.mp4?t=1787628064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📱RUMBLE AT HOME OR ON THE GO</h2>Sonic Rumble Party is available on both PC and mobile, offering a seamless and speedy experience whenever and wherever! Dash into the world of Sonic and experience the thrill and mayhem on your preferred platform.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/f8d84c7cd9f4102b26bf871818765243.poster.avif?t=1787628064\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/f8d84c7cd9f4102b26bf871818765243.webm?t=1787628064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/f8d84c7cd9f4102b26bf871818765243.mp4?t=1787628064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></v